<p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:'Gotham','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:900;line-height:40px;color:#E40147;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">20% de descuento</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-family:'Gotham','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:21px;font-weight:500;color:#3D3D3D;">en tu primera compra en PIA</p>
